    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Exploring Images\r\n\r\nIn this level, we'll use AI Tutor to help us understand image tags and add a new image to our webpage.\r\n\r\n**A Note on Image Generation:** AI Tutor is not an \"image generator\", so it can't create brand-new images and put them in your webpage. Instead, it can take images already in your project (or ones you upload yourself) and insert them into your website.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1) Ask AI Tutor to explain how image tags work in HTML\r\n    - You can send AI Tutor a message directly, or highlight the code and select \"Add to AI Tutor\"\r\n2) Ask AI Tutor to add one of the unused images to this page. Use specific language, like \"image tag\" or `<img>`, to make sure AI follows your vision.\r\n\r\nOnce you've added your own image: press the Continue button!",
